---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="页面没有找到">
  <div class="review-page">
    <section class="review-intro">
      <span class="page-eyebrow">404 / PAGE NOT FOUND</span>
      <h1>这一步，暂时没有内容。</h1>
      <p>从学习路线继续，或回到首页查看两个交互案例。</p>
    </section>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/learn/" class="p-button p-button-primary">
        返回学习路线 →
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="p-button">
        回到首页
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
